  {
   "id": "xiii-117509@post-2020-12-07",
   "gameId": "xiii-117509",
   "displayName": "XIII - Patch Notes - 07/12/2020",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2020-12-07T17:00:23.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Greetings,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A new patch for XIII is now available, which includes additional fixes for the issues that players have been encountering.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Ever since the launch of the game, our teams have been listening to the community’s feedback and are working hard on the release of new updates and patches to fix the game’s issues and bugs. Rest assured that we will keep working on providing players with regular patches that will allow for an improved playing experience.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "You'll find below a summary of this patch's fixes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Weapon improvements (balancing, animations and other tweaks, projectiles, multiplayer pickups)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Better Gameplay experience with many AI fixes (better reaction and behavior, tweaks on some bosses), further audio additions and some fixes on ragdoll system",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Art debugging and improvements (various collision and occlusion bugs, more polish in levels)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "The full patch notes are available on Microids' official website: HERE",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
